## Modifications

This repository contains substantial modifications to the upstream frontend and
a new desktop runtime, including but not limited to:

- New visual identity, layout, typography, color system, and application shell
  (sidebar, custom title bar, mobile navigation).
- A redesigned discovery home with a featured hero and horizontal media rails.
- A new anime section with a weekly simulcast calendar, local watchlist, and
  Douban-based fallback when Bangumi is unreachable.
- New local-first desktop integration: per-user local server, automatic local
  session, tray menu, single-instance handling, window-state persistence, and
  system-following theme.
- Rebranded metadata, icons, manifest, and player poster.
- Packaging scripts for a Windows portable build.

The source protocol names `LibreTV-SourceList` and `LibreTV-Settings` are kept
for compatibility with existing source lists and settings exports.

